{
  "_comment": [
    "SEEDED EDUCATION KNOWLEDGE BASE — the single source of truth for what a",
    "scholastic subject / co-scholastic area / grade / section name IS.",
    "",
    "Consumed by BOTH languages, from this one file:",
    "  - functions/generate_import/education_kb.py  (import parser + cleaning layer)",
    "  - src/utils/educationKB.js                   (School Setup + import review UI)",
    "",
    "It lives in the Cloud Function's own source directory on purpose: `gcloud",
    "functions deploy --source .` only uploads this folder, so keeping the file",
    "here means the deployed parser and the browser bundle can never drift apart",
    "and there is no copy/sync step to forget. The Vue side imports it by",
    "relative path; Vite inlines it at build time.",
    "",
    "Learned additions live in the Firestore `kb_entries` overlay (same",
    "self-learning pattern as import_aliases) — never edited into this file by",
    "code. Only humans edit this file.",
    "",
    "Aliases are matched after canonicalize() on both sides (lowercase, strip",
    "spaces/hyphens/dots), so 'Art & Craft', 'art&craft' and 'ART - CRAFT' all",
    "hit the same entry — no need to list punctuation variants."
  ],
