  "_section_patterns_comment": [
    "Section names are open-ended, so these are PATTERNS/vocabularies rather than",
    "a closed canonical list: a school can call a section anything. A value that",
    "matches one of these families is a confident section; a short unmatched word",
    "in a section-shaped context is a low-confidence section (LLM fallback",
    "territory). Names are stored title-cased as the canonical display form."
  ],
